# Build context exclusions.
#
# Without this the context is ~940MB, 825MB of which is node_modules — and the
# Dockerfile's `COPY lib/` and `COPY artifacts/api-server/` would copy host
# node_modules straight into the image, on top of the `pnpm install` that just
# ran. Host modules can be built for a different platform than the Alpine image,
# so that is a correctness problem as well as a slow upload.
#
# `railway up` also uploads this context over the network, so every exclusion
# here is time saved on every deploy.

# ── Dependencies: installed inside the image, never copied in ────────────────
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store

# ── Build output: rebuilt inside the image ───────────────────────────────────
dist
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Secrets: must never enter an image layer ─────────────────────────────────
# .env is gitignored, but .dockerignore is a separate list — a file excluded
# from git is still uploaded by `railway up` unless it is named here too.
.env
**/.env
.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.crt

# ── Version control and tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude
.agents
.migration-backup
.replit
.replitignore
replit.md

# ── The mobile app: not part of the API image ────────────────────────────────
artifacts/lense-mobile
artifacts/mockup-sandbox
attached_assets
.expo
**/.expo

# ── Docs and scripts the runtime does not need ───────────────────────────────
docs
scripts
*.md
!README.md

# ── Local noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
coverage
**/coverage
*.log
